 "You first need to choose a metal.\n\nYou'll earn metal ores to use later,\nbut right now you have an unlimited\nsupply of copper to use.": "首先，你需要选择一种金属。你之后会获得矿石，但现在你可以无限使用铜。",
 "Wait for the copper to melt!\n\nYou can also pump the bellows to make\nthe metal melt faster.": "等待铜融化！你也可以操作风箱来加速金属融化。",
 "The metal is ready! Slowly pull the chain downwards to pour into the sword mold.": "金属准备好了！慢慢向下拉动链条，将其倒入剑的模具中。",
 "If you pull too fast, the metal will spill\nand your sword won't form correctly!": "如果你拉得太快，金属会溢出，你的剑就无法正确成型！",
 "You need to hammer a sword to sharpen its edges. Click along the edges of the sword to hammer.": "你需要锤炼剑以磨利其边缘。点击剑的边缘进行锤炼。",
 "You can only swing the hammer 18 times, so try to space your hammering to make it all the way around the sword blade!": "你只能挥动锤子 18 次，所以尽量均匀地锤炼，让它覆盖整个剑刃！",
 "You build the handle of a sword by dropping parts onto it. First drag and release a Guard onto the sword's end.": "你可以通过将部件放置在剑上来制作剑柄。首先，将一个护手拖动并释放到剑的末端。",
