 "Parts that are Bookmarked will show this icon:": "OK",
 "When you craft great weapons and earn points on a weapon's\nStar Meter, you can unlock extra Elemental Boosts\nfor each weapon type!": "当你制作出优秀的武器并在武器的星星计量条上获得积分时，你可以为每种武器类型解锁额外的元素强化！",
 "Want to multitask?Click the Back button to take otherweapon orders and switch to other stations!": "OK",
