 "If you attach a part poorly, you may not get the full\nElemental Boost amount, so be careful!": "OK",
 "Used in an Epic Weapon Design\nthat you've collected in Battle": "OK",
 "Weapon Boosts": "OK",
 "Each weapon variation comes with different Elemental Boosts.": "OK",
 "If you make a great weapon, that variation's Star Meter\nwill start to fill up. When the meter is completely full,\nyou will unlock EXTRA Elemental Boosts for that\nweapon variation!": "OK",
 "Each variation starts with one Boost,\nand has three extra Boosts to unlock\n(Bronze, Silver, and Gold)": "OK",
