 "Battle Screen": "OK",
 "A: Soldiers' weapons and durability remaining\nB: Enemies on this trail\nC: Current enemy (highlighted)\nD: Enemy Health Bar\nE: Enemy Element\n(will flash when you deal Elemental Damage)\nF: Your cannonballs\nG: Recharging timer around a cannonball": "OK",
 "Enemies": "OK",
 "In the Lowlands, you'll only see basic enemies.\nOnce you reach Cinder Springs and beyond, you'll start\nseeing stronger Elemental Enemies as well!": "OK",
 "Elemental Enemies are each weak against a certain Elemental Boost. Build weapons that deal extra elemental damage for these enemies!": "OK",
 "As you travel further, monsters will get larger and stronger!": "OK",
 "Check the \"Beasts\" Book to see all of the types of\nmonsters you've already encountered.": "查看“野兽”书以查看你已经遇到的所有怪物类型。",
 "Loot": "OK",
 "Enemies will drop loot every time a soldier attacks!\nMove your mouse over dropped loot to collect it.": "OK",
 "When you defeat an enemy, they'll spray extra loot down\nthe trail. This loot usually contains better metals and\nweapon parts.": "OK",
 "If you craft stronger weapons, enemies may drop\nbetter metal ores as loot! When you start crafting Bronze\nweapons, enemies will start dropping some Iron Ore.": "OK",
 "Use weapon parts with a Luck Boost ( ), and\nenemies will have a chance to drop more loot and\nbetter metal ores!": "OK",
 "Treasure": "OK",
 "If you defeat all of the enemies on a trail, you'll reach\na Treasure Chest that has special loot: An Epic Weapon Design\nand the parts required to build it!": "OK",
 "You won't always reach the Treasure Chest if your\nweapons break, so you won't always get a new Epic Weapon.": "OK",
 "Be sure to collect all of the parts that pour out of the\nTreasure Chest, including the Design Scroll!": "OK",
 "Don't worry if you don't reach the Treasure Chest each day!\nThe Design and parts in that Treasure Chest will be\navailable in other Treasure Chests during future battles.": "OK",
 "Cannon": "OK",
 "You will eventually unlock a Cannon for your wagon,\nso you can help your troops in battle!": "OK",
 "Click on one of the Cannonball buttons to launch\na cannonball into the field.": "OK",
 "Large Widescreen": "OK",
 "After you use your cannon, it will need to recharge\nbefore you can fire that type of cannonball again.": "OK",
 "You will unlock some cannonballs that fire at\nyour troops instead of the enemy!\n\nThe Repair Bomb will repair some of\nthe durability on all of your weapons.\n\nThe Booster Bomb will give all of your soldiers a\nboosted attack power for a limited time!": "OK",
 "Some cannonballs will affect the enemies\ntemporarily!\n\nThe Fire Bomb will slowly deal damage to the enemy\nas the fire burns.\n\nThe Lightning Bomb will zap an enemy's attack\npower for a limited time, so you take less damage\nfrom their attacks.\n\nThe Ice Bomb will freeze an enemy in place for a limited\ntime, so they can't fight back!": "OK",
 "Finding and Browsing": "OK",
 "If you defeat all of the monsters on a trail, you'll reach a\nTreasure Chest that contains an Epic Weapon Design and the\nparts needed to build it. Be sure to collect everything\nthat drops out of the chest!": "OK",
 "Click the \"Designs\" book to browse through any\nWeapon Designs you've collected.\nYou can also press D on the keyboard, or go to the\nDesigns page from the MENU button.": "OK",
 "A: Tabs for different weapon types\nB: List of designs found for this weapon type\nC: Parts needed to build this weapon\nD: Bonus Effect given to soldiers when you build this\nE: Bookmark Button": "OK",
 "Design names will be shown in GREEN in the list if youcurrently have all of the parts and metals needed to build it.": "OK",
 "Design names will have a Star if you've built at least one\nof this Epic Weapon before.": "OK",
 "Bonus Effects": "OK",
 "Each Epic Weapon design gives a Bonus Effect to ALL\nof the soldiers on that day if you build one.": "如果你制作一件史诗武器设计图，它会给当天所有的士兵提供一个额外效果。",
 "This Bonus Effect is added to each weapon's stats during\nthe battle.": "OK",
 "Need to face some Fire Enemies?\nTry building an Epic Weapon that gives a bonus\nFire Boost to all of your soldiers.": "OK",
 "Even if this weapon uses a low-quality metal, it may be even\nmore helpful to build it and gain the Fire Boost for everyone!": "OK",
 "Bookmarks": "OK",
 "You won't always have the parts needed to make one\nof your Epic Weapons.": "OK",
 "You can \"Bookmark\" a design's parts so you don't\naccidentally use them on a different weapon.": "OK",
 "Bookmarked parts will show a striped background and\nBookmark icon when you're building and browsing\nyour inventory:": "OK",
 "You can have multiple designs bookmarked at once,\nand you can remove a bookmark whenever you like.": "OK",
 "Bookmark ribbons will be colored to match the type\nof weapon that the part is needed for.": "OK",
