 "Any parts that are used in an Epic Weapon Design\nyou have collected, even if it isn't currently\nbookmarked, will also show this icon:": "即使当前未标记，任何用于你已收集的史诗武器设计的部件也会显示此图标：",
 "After you craft an Epic Weapon, it will automatically\nremove that bookmark (if it was bookmarked).": "OK",
 "If a part is used in Epic Weapon Designs you have\ncollected, but you've already made those designs at\nleast once, it will instead show this icon:": "如果某个部件用于你已收集的史诗武器设计，但你已经至少制作过一次这些设计，它将显示此图标：",
 "Use those small scroll symbols to decide if you want to save\na part to use in a Design later, or if something is safe\nto use in your current weapon.": "OK",
